  power, the fan row: pwr_budget.py's cooler row 0.36 / 0.51 / 0.56 W per slot (a representative 30 mm 5 V fan, not the pick); the pick prints 2.0 W at full speed
  choice (a), a step-up per slot (SELECTED): 2.353 W on +5V_Sn per slot at full speed, 0.461 A at 5.1 V (0.480 A at 4.9 V), +0.353 W of conversion per slot; the three 7.84 W at VBAT behind the slot converters
  choice (b), one 12 V feed from board A over the bay harness: the three 6.74 W at VBAT; (b) is 1.10 W lower at full speed, 0.31 W at the budget's 0.56 W a fan

